{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0132_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "5a4e9f050c588e4e1e4d05c97a15bd799c53dfb0059d683a27af40b2cee573b9", "ja": "あのね、この前、体験教室で\nランチョンマットを作ったでしょ？", "zh": "那个呀，我之前不是参加体验教室，\n做了午餐垫吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0132_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "f913156c7c545fadaac1ae636df29769ba2c3a7c4a4dbf899f7dff47893893af", "ja": "あれからわたし、おかあさんに習って、\nいろいろなものを作ってみてるんだ！", "zh": "自那之后，我就跟妈妈学习，\n试着自己做了不少东西喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0132_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3fea9e2264c2516cf3ae73616fe8c9d1b2bf1bfa6f4513604a365d75831eec47", "ja": "へぇ、そうなのか！\nたとえば、どんなものを作ってるんだ？", "zh": "哦～是这样啊！\n那你都做了些什么东西呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0132_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "01f87ec6d465a99e882624e79df3876708b2693eea574f09a0386db3360409a1", "ja": "えっとね、ハンカチ入れでしょ。\nあと、お弁当を入れるふくろでしょ。それから……。", "zh": "我看看，有手帕的收纳袋、\n便当袋，还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0132_1007_p", "source_sha256": "97eca5dacf36e2db784a85fd16a599f7f4879a7f45f7c747109b0a57c66a5898", "ja": "そんなに色々作ってるのか？\n育はすごいな！", "zh": "育做了这么多东西啊？\n真是厉害呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0132_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "39493ecfce16c454648846adb044224e82c1b010fb9cca48a353b6d875adc700", "ja": "えへへ、そんなことないよ！\nむずかしいところは、おかあさんが手伝ってくれるし。", "zh": "嘿嘿，也没有啦！\n比较困难的地方都是妈妈帮我的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0132_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "33362bc23416f6f7d1031be72d958821dacdf3918b48b5b2f5fb7b01849b28f9", "ja": "そうだ！　今度、{$P$}さんにも\nなにか作ってあげるね♪　楽しみにしてて！", "zh": "对了！我下次也做个什么送给\n{$P$}先生好了♪你就好好期待吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
